# git-LFS is NOT in use in this repo.
#
# This file previously held 11 `filter=lfs` patterns. Every one of them was dead:
#   * 9 matched files that exist on disk but are untracked (app/modelling/, modelling2/,
#     daily_data/ -- none of which are committed);
#   * 2 matched nothing at all.
# `git lfs ls-files` reported zero LFS-tracked files at HEAD, both before and after the
# 2026-07 restructure. The 13 real LFS objects that do exist live only in history, under
# app/site_analysis/modelling/ds/datasets/, a path that no longer exists at HEAD.
#
# The one genuinely large tracked file, proforma/v1_5/artifacts/coldstart_artifacts.joblib
# (~46 MB), is stored as an ordinary inline git blob, not an LFS pointer. Do not "fix" that
# by adding an LFS pattern for it: converting an already-committed inline blob to LFS
# rewrites how git stores existing history and buys nothing here.
#
# If you reintroduce LFS, add the pattern BEFORE committing the file, then verify with
# `git lfs ls-files` -- a pattern added afterwards silently does nothing.
